  margin_stability reject  25%  book +11.3%/yr  excess +2.6  win 84%  worst -14.4  OOS +0.7/+4.5
  (gate-off rows repeat the baseline; a reject-% lifting book or worst with OOS both + -> ship as a survival gate.)

── TWO-STYLE HELD BOOK (growth_score book + pure-earnings_yield book, equal-weight UNION, held 12y no-sell) ──
  growth top-10  [baseline]  book +11.4%/yr  excess +2.8  win 84%  worst -14.4  OOS +0.9/+4.6
  value  top-10              book +12.4%/yr  excess +0.8  win 88%  worst -1.0  OOS +0.6/+1.0
  combo  5g+5v               book +11.6%/yr  excess +2.9  win 82%  worst -14.4  OOS +0.9/+4.8  (mean size 4.2, overlap 0.1/window)
  combo  10g+10v             book +11.3%/yr  excess +2.6  win 84%  worst -14.4  OOS +0.9/+4.3  (mean size 7.4, overlap 0.6/window)
